# ProfitLens environment variables. Copy to .env.local and fill in.
#
# Leave BOTH values empty to run in DEMO MODE: accounts and data are stored in the
# browser's localStorage on that device only (clearly labelled in the UI).
#
# Supabase → Project Settings → API. These two values are public by design; data is
# protected by the Row Level Security policies in supabase/migrations.
# NEVER put the service_role key here or anywhere in this app.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
